📝 Preparing for Wayfair
Practice focus:

DSA: arrays, strings, hash maps, graphs, DP

Large-integer operations in strings

Graph traversal & connectivity

Matrix traversal with constraints

SQL fundamentals: joins, window functions, grouping

Design prep:

LLD: well-defined class diagrams

HLD: scalability, trade-offs, querying patterns

✅ Summary Table
Category	Sample Problem Types
DSA	Two-sum; string addition; LCS; graph connectivity; matrix jumps
SQL	YoY metrics; monthly averages; top-N per category
LLD/HLD	Parking lot design; music recommender; API + DB schemas



